{"path":"utility/any/~any","title":"std::any::~any","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::any::</span>~any","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/any/~any","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Destroys the contained object, if any, as if by a call to reset().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">~any<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destroys the contained object, if any, as if by a call to <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any/reset\"><code>reset()</code></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;any&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> X\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    X<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"X::X()\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    X<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> X<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"X::X(const X&amp;)\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    ~X<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"X::~X()\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any\"><span class=\"kw1078\">std::<span class=\"me2\">any</span></span></a> a<span class=\"br0\">{</span>X<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Leaving main()...\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>X::X()\nX::X(const X&amp;)\nX::~X()\nLeaving main()...\nX::~X()</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any/reset\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reset</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destroys contained object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/any","title":"std::any"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::any::~any","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Destroys the contained object, if any, as if by a call to reset()."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"reset","note":"destroys contained object"}]}]},"standard